WEBVTT

00:05.170 --> 00:08.270
ONE MONTH EARLIER

00:10.280 --> 00:14.030
I'd like you to do something 
about this, Captain.

00:15.180 --> 00:17.450
I've seen those symptoms before.

00:17.900 --> 00:19.410
Sheesh...

00:19.700 --> 00:21.110
Happiness.

00:22.150 --> 00:23.410
I knew it.

00:24.100 --> 00:26.090
Have you been making 
time to see her lately?

00:27.630 --> 00:28.800
I see.

00:28.800 --> 00:32.470
Hmm... I guess we'll ask the guild 
for a quest as an excuse again

00:32.470 --> 00:35.160
and invite Happiness and 
Cecilia to go with us.

00:35.160 --> 00:35.930
Uh...

00:36.290 --> 00:40.060
Could he not just invite 
her on a date like normal?

00:40.160 --> 00:49.770
DATE?!

00:40.340 --> 00:42.600
A d-date?!

00:43.540 --> 00:47.940
I have two superiors who can't even 
ask the girls they like on a date.

00:48.280 --> 00:49.770
My life sucks.

00:49.770 --> 00:52.280
O-Okay!

00:52.730 --> 00:56.650
Operation Go on a Group Date as 
a Drastic Measure to Help Raven...

00:56.650 --> 00:58.330
is underway!

02:31.700 --> 02:33.000
Sunny day.

02:33.490 --> 02:35.710
Isn't the weather just lovely?

02:35.710 --> 02:38.840
Let's do our best to 
have lots of fun today!

02:38.840 --> 02:42.620
Hey, Duke, since when were 
you and Irene a thing?

02:42.940 --> 02:46.100
When I said we were giving 
the captain a break,

02:46.100 --> 02:48.060
she said she wanted to help.

02:46.380 --> 02:50.170
I'm so excited! I hope we 
find something good to eat!

02:50.170 --> 02:52.820
All right, we're heading out now.

02:53.610 --> 02:56.070
So where are we headed, anyway?

02:56.410 --> 02:58.680
There's someplace Happiness wants to go.

02:58.680 --> 03:00.360
We're starting with that.

03:00.610 --> 03:01.860
Dying to.

03:01.130 --> 03:02.240
WHERE?

03:02.240 --> 03:05.330
Oh, you mean the famous spot 
that just opened recently?

03:05.330 --> 03:06.500
You nailed it.

03:06.850 --> 03:10.210
A famous spot that just 
opened? You don't mean...

03:13.310 --> 03:17.440
LET'S GO TO A BAKERY.

03:16.050 --> 03:17.080
Refuse.

03:18.440 --> 03:20.380
LET'S GET LUNCH!

03:19.000 --> 03:20.380
Too early.

03:28.530 --> 03:30.490
That place will probably be crowded,

03:30.490 --> 03:33.910
and if we go there, it 
could lead to chaos.

03:33.910 --> 03:35.530
Let's not do that today.

03:36.520 --> 03:37.750
Break free!

03:48.410 --> 03:50.490
Wow...

03:50.490 --> 03:52.420
This looks amazing!

03:53.010 --> 03:56.920
The king made it to celebrate 
the Demon King's defeat.

03:59.160 --> 04:00.410
Identical.

04:00.570 --> 04:03.430
PLEASE DON'T LOOK.

04:04.280 --> 04:05.840
Don't be modest.

04:05.840 --> 04:07.950
I'm proud.

04:18.370 --> 04:20.120
Looks like it's going well.

04:20.430 --> 04:22.780
The plan's clearly a success.

04:24.040 --> 04:26.900
Happiness, you have cream on your cheek.

04:27.250 --> 04:28.520
Captain?

04:31.710 --> 04:33.660
It is the captain.

04:33.660 --> 04:36.030
But that voice we just heard...

04:36.030 --> 04:37.290
Right?

04:38.700 --> 04:41.180
I see. So sorry.

04:41.180 --> 04:44.250
This is the first time 
we've heard your voice,

04:44.250 --> 04:47.090
so we were a bit surprised.

04:51.610 --> 04:52.550
Rude!

04:54.150 --> 04:56.870
Vice Captain, good to see you.

04:56.870 --> 04:59.040
The captain's off duty today,

04:59.040 --> 05:02.030
so don't worry about him. You 
can continue your patrol.

05:02.030 --> 05:06.780
Hah! He has not only his subordinate, 
but a fragile girl defending him?

05:08.550 --> 05:11.550
Please, go ahead and enjoy your day off,

05:11.550 --> 05:13.070
"Sir Raven."

05:19.560 --> 05:21.810
Um... Captain?

05:22.130 --> 05:23.210
Raven...

05:29.550 --> 05:31.130
Hey! Raven!

05:31.130 --> 05:32.690
I'll bring him right back!

05:32.690 --> 05:34.180
I'll go with you!

05:37.130 --> 05:41.010
I don't blame him for being shocked, 
but I didn't think he'd run away.

05:41.010 --> 05:45.110
There were always some knights who didn't 
like having a captain who didn't talk.

05:45.110 --> 05:49.370
It was the vice captain who brought 
them all together as a faction.

05:50.290 --> 05:51.910
I'm still a rookie,

05:52.440 --> 05:54.700
so there's only so much I 
can do to stick up for him.

05:55.170 --> 05:57.640
You've got it harder than I thought.

05:59.080 --> 06:00.290
Over there!

06:03.800 --> 06:06.250
This game of tag is over.

06:06.250 --> 06:07.960
Let's head back to the others.

06:08.450 --> 06:10.840
What's going to happen if I go back?

06:10.840 --> 06:11.890
What?!

06:12.250 --> 06:15.110
You're running away because 
you got embarrassed?

06:15.110 --> 06:17.900
So you never want to see 
Happiness again, then?

06:17.900 --> 06:19.230
That's...

06:19.580 --> 06:23.050
I thought I was fine with it 
as long as Happiness was happy.

06:23.470 --> 06:24.980
What a letdown.

06:26.980 --> 06:30.040
If you still insist on keeping 
silent, I guess it is what it is.

06:30.540 --> 06:32.240
He's all yours from here.

06:36.570 --> 06:38.220
What's really wrong?

06:38.660 --> 06:43.810
Lately, I've been reminded of 
my own weakness and powerlessness.

06:44.170 --> 06:46.690
You remember that quest 
we did at the ocean?

06:47.910 --> 06:52.680
That day, Happiness told 
me she had a secret.

06:54.070 --> 06:56.390
She seemed to be afraid of something,

06:56.890 --> 06:59.130
so it must be a really big deal.

07:01.130 --> 07:04.860
But how can I accept 
whatever her secret is

07:05.330 --> 07:08.070
when all I ever do is worry and fret?

07:09.130 --> 07:10.900
It's the same with my voice.

07:11.940 --> 07:13.700
All I've done is run from it.

07:14.290 --> 07:15.720
If only I could

07:16.140 --> 07:19.780
have the courage to approach 
the girl I love, like you do...

07:19.780 --> 07:20.910
Say what?!

07:21.890 --> 07:24.770
Just who do you think I am?

07:24.770 --> 07:27.030
I went out alone with the girl I love,

07:27.030 --> 07:30.550
but I'm such a shy loser, I had 
to wear a mask the whole time!

07:30.550 --> 07:33.050
On your feet, Raven!

07:33.050 --> 07:36.820
Those legs aren't just for 
show, are they?! Hell no!

07:36.820 --> 07:39.430
I know you're not that weak!

07:39.690 --> 07:40.810
How do I know?

07:40.810 --> 07:42.940
Because I, like Duke and Happiness,

07:43.190 --> 07:45.590
have faith in you!

07:47.730 --> 07:52.090
That bizarre mood you create 
always cheers me up somehow.

07:56.750 --> 07:58.370
I'm sorry, everyone.

08:03.060 --> 08:05.800
I'm sorry I acted selfishly.

08:07.290 --> 08:08.350
Forgiven.

08:12.630 --> 08:15.750
Okay, now that the captain's 
game of tag is over,

08:16.120 --> 08:18.600
we're going shopping next!

08:18.600 --> 08:20.600
I can't wait!

08:25.080 --> 08:26.140
Happiness...

08:27.130 --> 08:29.110
I know you can't rely on me now,

08:29.610 --> 08:32.860
but I'll try harder so you can 
entrust me with your secret one day.

08:34.670 --> 08:35.870
Acknowledged.

08:36.870 --> 08:40.390
A FEW DAYS LATER

08:39.380 --> 08:40.870
Yoki!

08:42.210 --> 08:44.140
What is it, Cecilia?

08:44.700 --> 08:47.550
Happiness has gone missing!

08:47.550 --> 08:48.880
What?!

08:49.380 --> 08:53.380
Happiness did put in a 
request for extended leave,

08:54.290 --> 08:56.490
but this note she wrote is so puzzling...

08:58.590 --> 09:01.010
Yep, it's written the way she talks.

09:01.820 --> 09:03.480
What does it mean?

09:03.480 --> 09:07.230
ONE MONTH 
COME FIND 
FOREST

09:03.480 --> 09:07.230
It says, "Come find me in 
the forest in one month."

09:07.860 --> 09:09.790
What forest is she talking about?

09:10.220 --> 09:13.010
I think I might know.

09:13.950 --> 09:17.380
Happiness must have something in mind.

09:22.540 --> 09:24.200
Happy!

09:25.590 --> 09:26.370
Hi.

09:27.000 --> 09:31.170
Man, don't make me track you down 
with my enhanced sense of smell.

09:31.170 --> 09:32.340
Trust.

09:32.340 --> 09:34.340
Everyone's worried about you, y'know.

09:35.010 --> 09:38.300
I've made up my mind, so...

09:38.970 --> 09:41.850
I'm going to tell him...

09:42.670 --> 09:44.250
about me.

09:45.500 --> 09:46.850
You're sure?

09:47.880 --> 09:52.360
If Raven doesn't accept it, 
you could lose everything.

09:53.640 --> 09:54.860
I know.

09:54.860 --> 09:59.810
They might want to investigate your 
relationship to us and the captain, too.

10:00.140 --> 10:01.560
If that happens...

10:01.560 --> 10:03.700
I won't cause trouble.

10:03.700 --> 10:06.120
This goes way beyond just causing trouble.

10:06.630 --> 10:08.410
Me, Shiek, the captain...

10:08.930 --> 10:12.130
We could all lose everything we've 
gained since coming to Minerva.

10:14.230 --> 10:16.340
Then again, you're smart,

10:17.060 --> 10:18.840
so I'm sure you know all that.

10:19.380 --> 10:21.320
I won't lie anymore.

10:21.320 --> 10:23.350
I want him to know.

10:29.270 --> 10:30.890
You can do this, Happy!

10:30.890 --> 10:31.990
Shiek...

10:32.600 --> 10:36.010
This is really important to you, right?

10:36.010 --> 10:38.450
So I'll be rooting for you!

10:38.830 --> 10:41.110
You feel the same, right, Duke?

10:41.460 --> 10:42.800
That's right.

10:42.800 --> 10:45.540
If that's how strong your resolve is,

10:45.540 --> 10:48.120
don't worry about us. Just go and do it.

10:49.870 --> 10:50.890
Thank you.

10:51.260 --> 10:53.570
You gotta say something too, Captain!

10:53.570 --> 10:58.050
But you guys summed it 
all up so nicely for me.

10:58.490 --> 11:00.090
I have nothing to add.

11:00.090 --> 11:01.890
Useless.

11:02.890 --> 11:05.130
Kidding. Captain...

11:05.640 --> 11:07.020
Thank you.

11:16.780 --> 11:20.740
Well, if it isn't Sir Raven. 
How are you feeling today?

11:21.250 --> 11:23.000
I feel just fine.

11:24.060 --> 11:25.210
That voice...

11:25.880 --> 11:27.100
You're being rude!

11:27.910 --> 11:29.660
Why do you call me by name?

11:29.880 --> 11:31.210
Huh?

11:31.210 --> 11:33.000
I'm not such a fool

11:33.530 --> 11:37.710
as to let a knight who disrupts 
the order with his lack of manners

11:38.200 --> 11:39.720
serve as vice captain.

11:40.620 --> 11:44.220
Wh-What do you mean by that, Sir Raven?

11:44.780 --> 11:46.220
You will call me "Captain."

11:54.410 --> 11:57.430
My apologies, Captain.

11:58.440 --> 12:00.440
THAT'S BETTER.

12:08.100 --> 12:11.000
ONE MONTH LATER

12:11.620 --> 12:16.000
It's been just about a month 
now since Happiness went away.

12:16.870 --> 12:20.010
Do you think she's going to...

12:20.010 --> 12:23.000
It's exactly what you're imagining.

12:23.000 --> 12:27.160
Duke should be taking Raven to 
where Happiness is as we speak.

12:31.630 --> 12:33.540
I didn't realize that Yoki was here.

12:33.540 --> 12:34.940
Mother...

12:34.940 --> 12:38.180
You told him about your marriage 
arrangement, didn't you?

12:38.180 --> 12:39.300
No.

12:39.300 --> 12:40.180
What?

12:40.180 --> 12:43.840
He has his hands full dealing 
with his friends right now.

12:43.840 --> 12:46.780
I don't want to give him 
more to worry about.

12:46.780 --> 12:51.400
Are you sure? Your future husband 
has already arrived in Minerva.

12:51.400 --> 12:53.790
Yoki is going to find out eventually.

12:53.790 --> 12:57.200
I only agreed to meet him 
per the king's order.

12:57.200 --> 13:00.550
Once I meet him, I'll turn 
down the offer right away.

13:02.580 --> 13:04.280
Tell me, Cecilia...

13:04.280 --> 13:08.190
How do you really feel about Yoki?

13:08.190 --> 13:10.630
Yoki has nothing to do with anything!

13:11.690 --> 13:15.560
Anyway, please don't tell him 
about that without my permission!

13:15.560 --> 13:19.060
Hmm... So you do feel something after all.

13:19.500 --> 13:22.470
You're wrong! I just...

13:22.470 --> 13:23.710
Silly.

13:24.570 --> 13:26.570
If he really had nothing 
to do with anything,

13:26.570 --> 13:30.030
you wouldn't want to keep your marriage 
arrangement a secret from him.

13:51.910 --> 13:54.100
This is... Happiness's...

13:55.070 --> 13:56.090
Come with me.

14:01.380 --> 14:02.920
Where is Happiness?

14:06.410 --> 14:09.610
Yoki, I have to kill you.

14:09.610 --> 14:13.620
I thought if anyone could accept 
her, it'd be you. What a letdown.

14:13.620 --> 14:15.370
I could say the same about you.

14:16.870 --> 14:18.870
You're not seriously...

14:18.870 --> 14:20.440
There is nothing to discuss!

14:23.800 --> 14:25.380
Explain what's going on!

14:28.850 --> 14:32.140
I'm punishing you for hurting 
Happiness! Steel yourself!

14:32.590 --> 14:33.390
Wait!

14:37.390 --> 14:39.380
I said wait!

14:49.790 --> 14:50.710
What?!

14:54.710 --> 14:56.550
He's stronger than before?!

15:14.870 --> 15:17.310
So that's your true identity,

15:17.700 --> 15:18.590
Yoki.

15:19.310 --> 15:22.830
What did you do to Happiness, Raven?

15:24.230 --> 15:26.010
I don't need to tell you!

15:28.610 --> 15:30.240
That is...

15:30.240 --> 15:31.670
enough!

15:32.740 --> 15:35.240
Endless Dark!

15:47.500 --> 15:51.260
Do you get it now, Raven? 
You can't beat me.

15:52.690 --> 15:54.140
But I won't give up!

15:54.760 --> 15:56.420
Why are you so determined?

15:56.950 --> 15:59.270
What happened between you and Happiness?

15:59.710 --> 16:01.170
I promised her.

16:01.590 --> 16:05.830
She said you plucked every feather from 
her body to disguise her as a human,

16:05.830 --> 16:08.270
and she asked me to give 
you a beating for it.

16:08.600 --> 16:09.390
Wha?

16:10.780 --> 16:11.780
Huh?

16:12.060 --> 16:14.750
That's what's going on. So let's do this.

16:14.750 --> 16:16.290
Give me a break!

16:16.290 --> 16:19.790
If you give me a beating with 
that sword, even I'm gonna die!

16:20.020 --> 16:22.430
Oh... Well, then, I'll just...

16:22.950 --> 16:24.540
use the back edge.

16:24.830 --> 16:27.030
That sword's double-edged!

16:36.690 --> 16:39.190
Happiness!

16:42.550 --> 16:44.060
Doot do-doo!

16:45.540 --> 16:50.070
A mischievous spirit can 
only take you so far!

16:53.070 --> 16:54.130
Apology.

16:54.530 --> 16:55.570
I'm sorry.

16:57.180 --> 17:01.580
And? How did you two... 
well... settle things?

17:02.120 --> 17:04.080
Oh, well...

17:04.080 --> 17:06.750
Duke led me to a certain forest, and...

17:06.750 --> 17:09.090
You'll have to go on your own from here.

17:12.340 --> 17:13.180
Duke?

17:14.050 --> 17:18.330
You're gonna have to give 
Happiness an answer yourself.

17:22.840 --> 17:24.100
Happiness?

17:27.080 --> 17:29.360
Happiness, are you up there?

17:30.130 --> 17:32.610
Why... are you hiding?

17:32.890 --> 17:34.950
Visitor. Gratitude.

17:35.460 --> 17:37.750
Why did you want me to come here?

17:38.360 --> 17:39.870
This is...

17:40.550 --> 17:42.920
where I started.

17:43.270 --> 17:47.380
And... where I ended.

17:49.670 --> 17:52.100
So it's a place that means a lot to you.

17:53.550 --> 17:56.540
Raven, I'm glad I met you.

17:56.540 --> 17:58.790
Spending time with you is fun.

17:58.790 --> 18:00.890
I'd like to be together forever.

18:01.110 --> 18:01.930
I also—

18:01.930 --> 18:03.640
No! Don't come closer!

18:25.770 --> 18:27.410
I was scared.

18:27.410 --> 18:29.670
I couldn't keep lying forever.

18:30.170 --> 18:36.060
But... when I thought... 
it might mean the end...

18:41.690 --> 18:42.980
I'm sorry.

18:50.250 --> 18:51.430
Raven?

18:52.730 --> 18:55.700
I'm sorry I didn't notice.

18:56.630 --> 18:58.950
You've been suffering 
over this for so long.

18:59.540 --> 19:01.450
You won't reject me?

19:02.500 --> 19:06.440
Of course not. Because I love you.

19:06.440 --> 19:08.450
I guess that's not a 
sufficient reason, is it?

19:08.670 --> 19:10.940
I-I...

19:12.620 --> 19:13.960
love you, too.

19:15.480 --> 19:18.130
Then everything's fine, right?

19:18.910 --> 19:19.650
Yes.

19:27.720 --> 19:30.840
That's so sweet!

19:30.840 --> 19:32.380
That's way too sweet!

19:32.380 --> 19:37.730
Sweeter than the sugar 
cubes at Cecilia's house!

19:37.730 --> 19:41.130
You two had a fairy-tale ending like that,

19:41.130 --> 19:44.040
and you were talking about beating me up?!

19:44.040 --> 19:46.170
All right. I get it.

19:47.030 --> 19:50.750
Let me offer you my congratulations.

19:50.750 --> 19:52.500
Saint Chains!

19:52.500 --> 19:53.890
What's this for?!

19:53.890 --> 19:54.750
Undo!

19:55.040 --> 19:57.830
Oh! I'll put up a barrier 
to keep monsters out.

19:58.180 --> 20:00.510
Well, you two have a nice time now!

20:06.950 --> 20:08.310
What a relief.

20:09.170 --> 20:12.100
If, by some chance, Raven and 
Happiness didn't work out,

20:12.100 --> 20:14.900
we probably couldn't have tea 
together like this anymore.

20:16.680 --> 20:17.560
Cecilia?

20:17.560 --> 20:19.150
Oh, I'm sorry!

20:21.210 --> 20:25.270
Um... I'm going to be a 
little busy for a while,

20:25.270 --> 20:27.130
so I won't have much time for tea.

20:27.570 --> 20:30.160
Oh, but it's only for a little while!

20:30.160 --> 20:32.600
Oh, okay. Don't worry about it.

20:32.600 --> 20:34.960
I'll be away from Minerva for a while.

20:34.960 --> 20:35.420
Huh?

20:35.930 --> 20:39.430
Yuga asked me to help him with a quest,

20:39.820 --> 20:42.710
so I have to go to some mine somewhere.

20:42.710 --> 20:44.930
I... see...

20:47.220 --> 20:49.430
He kind of begged me.

20:49.930 --> 20:52.430
It might take two or three weeks.

20:53.320 --> 20:57.240
So at some point, you became 
good friends with Yuga, too?

20:57.240 --> 20:57.930
Huh?

20:59.420 --> 21:00.940
Is Yoki here?!

21:02.190 --> 21:04.830
Give Yoki to us.

21:04.830 --> 21:06.890
Apprehend! Haul in!

21:06.890 --> 21:09.700
Yoki, did you do something again?

21:11.340 --> 21:14.210
They messed with me first!

21:15.860 --> 21:17.300
Thanks for the tea!

21:21.250 --> 21:22.090
I'll come by again!

21:25.220 --> 21:26.220
Don't you run away!

21:26.220 --> 21:27.780
Annihilate!

21:27.780 --> 21:30.470
Honestly... You'd better.

21:32.710 --> 21:34.040
Let's go, too.

22:00.060 --> 22:02.450
Happiness! I'm happy for you!

22:02.450 --> 22:04.010
Congratulations!

22:07.780 --> 22:11.090
It seems we have a debt to 
Yoki that we can never repay.

22:11.090 --> 22:13.250
Thank you, Captain.
